OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'cozy' tunnels built for World
OL,4,AWar Two
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs many as 11,000 workers in Rochester
OL,7,Ffound themselves seeking refuge in a
OL,8,Fnetwork of tunnels built during World
OL,9,FWar Two.
OL,11,FThis network, which remains under the
OL,12,Ftown to this day, was built by the
OL,13,FShort Brothers in 1939 and 1940.
OL,15,FThe aviation pioneers employed about
OL,16,F15,000 people, the vast majority of
OL,17,Fwhom worked at their Rochester
OL,18,Fesplanade factory.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
